      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The theoretical and methodical base of computed tomography evaluation of the myocardial function are demonstrated. The possibilities and limits of this investigation method are discussed and compared with the results of numerous own examinations and the literature. Present indications for cardiacomputed tomography are deduced with consideration of other noninvasive imaging techniques in cardiology."},
